<title>USA: Total Control prices IPO at $8/shr.</title>
<headline>Total Control prices IPO at $8/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MELROSE PARK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total Control Products Inc said late Monday it began an initial public offering of two million shares of its common stock at a price of $8 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it would offer 1.65 million shares and certain selling stockholders would offer 350,000 shares.</p>
<p>Total Control said it granted underwriters an option to purchase 300,000 additional shares to cover over-allotment.</p>
<p>Net proceeds would be used to repay debt, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
